<title>USA: CalEnergy Co Inc Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>CalEnergy Co Inc Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share amounts, unaudited)</p>
<p>					   Three Months Ended March 31</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p>Revenues					 $565,976	$90,356</p>
<p>Income Before Provision for Income</p>
<p>   Taxes and Minority Interest		57,154	 20,958</p>
<p>Net Income Available for Common</p>
<p>   Shareholders				27,448(a)	 14,461</p>
<p> Net Income Per Common Share (Primary)	0.42	   0.27</p>
<p>Average Common and Common Equivalent</p>
<p>   Shares Outstanding			65,647(b)	 54,114</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Includes reduction of $7.4 million for minority interest during quarter ended March 31, 1997, reflecting acquisition on December 24, 1996 of majority interest in Northern Electric plc. (b) Reflects weighted average of outstanding shares and includes conversion of $64,850 9.5-percent convertible debt on September 20, 1996, and conversion of $100,000 convertible subordinated debentures in September and October 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
